==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 5 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Charcadet Drop Event]], which ran from March 11 to 21, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Frigibax|57}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*'''Stiffen''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Kakuna|33}} and {{TCG ID|Base Set|Metapod|54}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

